  dialogs:
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Welcome back! Shall we start the project?
  - name: Founder
    dialog: Yes
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Fine. I'll give you the first task today
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Let me prepare it for you
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Alright, task Issue #224
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: You need to create visual asset for the game
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Of course. All the asset must be made by us
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: As using free assets leads to mediocrity
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: But don't worry
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: As long as i'm here, that won't happen
